: {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/3c59/dc04/21_large.png?m=1650127623", "name": "shenzhen", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/3c59/dc04/21_normal.png?m=1650127623", "title": "深圳", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/shenzhen", "topics": 3581, "footer": "", "header": "", "title_alternative": "Shenzhen", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/3c59/dc04/21_mini.png?m=1650127623", "stars": 2138, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 21, "parent_node_name": "cn"}, "member": {"id": 698558, "username": "Bullish", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/Bullish", "website": "", "twitter": "", "psn": "", "github": "", "btc": "", "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0bac/e0c3/698558_mini.png?m=1760142421", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0bac/e0c3/698558_normal.png?m=1760142421", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0bac/e0c3/698558_large.png?m=1760142421", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0bac/e0c3/698558_xlarge.png?m=1760142421", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0bac/e0c3/698558_xxlarge.png?m=1760142421", "avatar_xxxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0bac/e0c3/698558_xxxlarge.png?m=1760142421", "created": 1719575876, "last_modified": 1760142421, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "allgy", "last_touched": 1785320190, "title": "深圳灵活就业社保费用一直涨，都快坚持不住了。", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1230577", "created": 1785285819, "deleted": 0, "content": "自费交了几年灵活就业社保了，记的刚开始交灵活就业社保时每个月还不到一千块。现在每个月是 1493.64 元（ 不知道后续还会不会继续涨 ），有时候想停交养老险，只交医疗保险（ 深圳的灵活就业社保是可以单独交的，没有绑定 ）。\r\n\r\n但是看缴费记录都已经累积 13 年了（ 本人九零后 ），到了一个比较尴尬的点，停了有点可惜，继续交不知道后面政策怎么变化，目前收入又断了，有点子坚持不住。", "content_rendered": "自费交了几年灵活就业社保了，记的刚开始交灵活就业社保时每个月还不到一千块。现在每个月是 1493.64 元（ 不知道后续还会不会继续涨 ），有时候想停交养老险，只交医疗保险（ 深圳的灵活就业社保是可以单独交的，没有绑定 ）。<br /><br />但是看缴费记录都已经累积 13 年了（ 本人九零后 ），到了一个比较尴尬的点，停了有点可惜，继续交不知道后面政策怎么变化，目前收入又断了，有点子坚持不住。", "last_modified": 1785285819, "replies": 70, "id": 1230577}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https: